SUMMARY:FOMC blackout
DESCRIPTION:FOMC communications blackout for the January 26–27\, 2021 mee
 ting. Begins 12:00 a.m. ET Saturday\, January 16 and ends 11:59 p.m. ET Th
 ursday\, January 28. Committee participants and staff generally don't spea
 k publicly about monetary policy during this period.\n\nCalculated from th
 e Fed's rule (second Saturday before the meeting through the day after). C
 heck the official calendar for exceptions: https://www.federalreserve.gov/
 monetarypolicy/files/fomc-blackout-period-calendar.pdf\nRule: https://www.
 federalreserve.gov/monetarypolicy/files/FOMC_ExtCommunicationParticipants.
 pdf
URL:https://www.federalreserve.gov/monetarypolicy/files/fomc-blackout-perio
 d-calendar.pdf
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
